  ok: a caller waits while the barrier is false
  ok: the caller is let through once the barrier is true
  ok: and not before the barrier became true
  ok: nothing is taken from an empty stock
  ok: one item put, one item taken
  ok: the consumer waits again at an empty stock
  ok: two items put, two more items taken
  ok: the handler is set
  ok: the handler has not run before its time
  ok: the handler has run once
  ok: and not before the time of the event
  ok: an event that has run has no handler
  ok: Cancel_Handler cancels a pending event
  ok: a cancelled event does not run
